<main>
  <h1>Privacy policy · Samac bills</h1>
  <p>Samac bills is a private tool to split a shared electricity bill between two apartments on Sant Antoni Maria Claret street (Barcelona). It is not a public or commercial service.</p>
  <h2>Data we process</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Name and WhatsApp number of the 4 people sharing the bill.</li>
    <li>WhatsApp messages sent to the Samac bills number, including electricity meter photos and readings.</li>
    <li>The Endesa electricity bills and the split calculation.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Purpose</h2>
  <p>Only to calculate how much each party pays and to notify them on WhatsApp. Meter photos are analysed automatically to read the consumption. The data is never sold or shared with third parties, except the technical providers needed to run the service (Meta/WhatsApp for messaging and Anthropic for reading the meter photo).</p>
  <h2>Retention</h2>
  <p>Bills, readings and photos are kept as evidence for as long as the bill is shared.</p>
  <h2>Data deletion</h2>
  <p>To delete your data, email <a href="mailto:<%= contact %>"><%= contact %></a> or send “delete my data” to the Samac bills WhatsApp number. It will be deleted within 30 days.</p>
  <p class="muted small">Last updated: November 2026.</p>
</main>
</body>
</html>
